    "description": "PCIe Protocol Model: Highly customizable model of the PCIe protocol. It is mainly written in C. Code base has a lot of legacy from many years.\n●\tImplemented new features for PCIe Gen4 and Gen5 as well as CCIX Transport Layer.\n●\tCreated a test suite for the new features using UVM. Some have been shared to customers as examples.\n●\tCoached and led a team of contractors to participate in test development activities.\n●\tDebugged diverse customer issues.\n",
